# HUONG DAN LAY COOKIE
# ---------------------
# 1. Mo Chrome, dang nhap vao https://community.arc.io (bang Gmail nhu binh thuong)
# 2. Bam F12 mo DevTools -> tab "Network"
# 3. Tai lai trang (F5). Click vao request dau tien (ten trang, vd "home" hoac "content")
# 4. Keo xuong phan "Request Headers" -> tim dong "cookie:"
# 5. Copy TOAN BO gia tri sau chu "cookie:" (rat dai)
# 6. Doi ten file nay thanh "cookie.txt" va dan gia tri vao (xoa het cac dong bat dau bang #)
#
# LUU Y AN TOAN:
# - Cookie nay = chia khoa dang nhap tai khoan Arc cua ban. KHONG share cho ai.
# - File chi nam tren may ban. Khong up len cloud cong khai.
# - Cookie se het han sau vai ngay/tuan -> luc do lam lai buoc tren.
#
# Dan cookie ngay duoi dong nay (1 dong duy nhat), roi luu file ten cookie.txt:
